      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
      "text": "......嗷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鲤",
      "text": "这是什么......尚蜀难道流行这样古怪的宠物吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的物件",
